S-120: board A's charge bus VBUS20 and the charger's switch nodes against the 30 V FETs of decision 57. MESHSAT-1357,
stream s120. Desk arithmetic on the makers' figures and the committed netlists; nothing is built, powered or measured.
INFERRED = a figure the maker does not state; MODEL = an estimate from a simplified circuit, not a bound.
netlist A v2/ecad/pcb-a-power-a23/out/pcb-a-power.net sha256/16 6c40250c47195ebb
netlist E v2/ecad/pcb-e1-dock-e7/out/pcb-e1-dock.net sha256/16 2ed95a0e8069ebf8

1. THE CIRCUIT AS GENERATED (parsed from the netlists)
   PASS U2 FB divider        R6 240k 1% VBUS20 to FE_FB, R7 10k 1% FE_FB to GND
