   PASS U2 MODE              R119 100k (MODE: CCM) from MODE to VCC: CCM, hiccup disabled (SNVSAI1D 7.4.2 p.20)
   PASS front end sense      R11 10mOhm 1% 2512 (ISNS) FE_OUT to VBUS20 (ISNS), R12 5mOhm 1% 2512 (CS) FE_CS to GND (CS)
   PASS L1                   L1 10uH XAL1010-103ME (Isat 17.5 A) between FE_SW1 and FE_SW2
