   PASS D1 on VBAT           D1 SMCJ18A (VBAT clamp), cathode on VBAT
   PASS D2 on VIN_RAW        D2 SMCJ40A, cathode on VIN_RAW
   PASS board E OVLO         U6 LM5069MM-2 hot-swap controller OVLO pin 4 from DC_P over R22 100k 1% and R23 6.65k 1%
